    "output": "Absolutely! One effective way to manage a team in a new company is to establish clear communication channels from the start. Encourage open dialogue where team members feel comfortable sharing ideas and feedback. Additionally, setting clear goals and expectations helps align the team's efforts. Building trust and fostering a positive team culture through team-building activities can also enhance collaboration. Finally, regularly check in on team dynamics and be open to adjusting your management style based on the team’s needs. How large is your team?",
